0..76 Comment "// A workspace is the packages that its `workspace.gandr` names. The checker"
77..154 Comment "// finds it above them. It is not a package. It states what its members share"
155..230 Comment "// as a model of `Gandr.Workspace`, which the package source of each member"
231..305 Comment "// imports. Each member that it names is a directory below it that roots a"
306..317 Comment "// package."
318..320 Comment "//"
321..393 Comment "// `gandr check` here checks this source and every member. It writes the"
394..471 Comment "// `package.gandr.toml` of each member and the `workspace.gandr.toml` of this"
472..548 Comment "// workspace. It also writes the one `workspace.gandr.lock` that the members"
549..558 Comment "// share."
559..584 Comment "// The manifest theories."
585..587 Comment "//"
588..603 Comment "// - see: #2687"
